• Which hazardous materials are present in our product, and where are they located?
• Can all hazardous components be removed in the first steps of disassembly without tools or with minimal tooling?
• Are hazardous modules sealed to prevent leakage during use, transport, and storage?
• Does the product design comply with current and upcoming regulations on hazardous substance management?
• How will workers be protected during the removal of hazardous components?